#: ../../source/index.rst:64 d9546b43e50f46169b892083c905cb2b
msgid ""
"Are you looking to enhance your trading strategies with the power of "
"Python and machine learning? **PyBroker** is a Python framework designed "
"for developing algorithmic trading strategies, with a focus on strategies"
" that use machine learning. With PyBroker, you can easily create and "
"fine-tune trading rules, build powerful models, and gain valuable "
"insights into your strategy's performance."
msgstr ""
"你是否希望借助 Python 和机器学习的力量来提升你的交易策略？**PyBroker** 是一个专为开发算法交易策略而设计的 Python "
"框架，尤其专注于使用机器学习的策略。借助 PyBroker，你可以轻松创建和微调交易规则，构建强大的模型，并深入了解你的策略表现。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:72 5141014a4d7b4d0ab960410f8a6b8386
msgid "Key Features"
msgstr "重要特性"

#: ../../source/index.rst:74 60d3fd39c5394defa707e2e2614a6a98
msgid ""
"A super-fast backtesting engine built in `NumPy <https://numpy.org/>`_ "
"and accelerated with `Numba <https://numba.pydata.org/>`_."
msgstr ""
"一个基于 `NumPy <https://numpy.org/>`_ 并通过 `Numba "
"<https://numba.pydata.org/>`_ 加速的超快回测引擎。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:75 20992239282f4c1abe1a4ed3aa1a5539
msgid ""
"Easy creation of trading rules and models for executing across multiple "
"instruments."
msgstr "能轻松地在多个金融工具上创建和执行交易规则和模型。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:76 4326240970b14dd098c177d8bb3c5554
msgid ""
"Integration of trading signals across `multiple time intervals "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/15.%20Multiple%20Time%20Intervals.html>`_,"
" including daily, weekly, and monthly."
msgstr ""
"跨 `多个时间区间 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/15.%20Multiple%20Time%20Intervals.html>`_"
" 整合交易信号，涵盖日线、周线和月线。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:77 6cc7a002fffe476180e67e132fb94c54
msgid ""
"Access to historical data from `Alpaca <https://alpaca.markets/>`_, "
"`Yahoo Finance <https://finance.yahoo.com/>`_, `AKShare "
"<https://github.com/akfamily/akshare>`_, or from `your own data provider "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/7.%20Creating%20a%20Custom%20Data%20Source.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"可以轻松从 `Alpaca <https://alpaca.markets/>`_, `Yahoo Finance "
"<https://finance.yahoo.com/>`_, `AKShare "
"<https://github.com/akfamily/akshare>`_, 或者从 `自定义的数据源 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/7.%20Creating%20a%20Custom%20Data%20Source.html>`_"
" 来获取历史数据。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:78 18f0384bbe1a4c89a191df99a8700bca
msgid ""
"Model training and backtesting using `Walkforward Analysis "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/6.%20Training%20a%20Model.html"
"#Walkforward-Analysis>`_, which simulates how the strategy would perform "
"during actual trading."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 `Walkforward Analysis "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/6.%20Training%20a%20Model.html"
"#Walkforward-Analysis>`_, 来训练和回测模型，该方法模拟了策略在实际交易中的表现。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:79 67ed7d06568840f3a7a9b00280fa6498
msgid ""
"Reliable trading metrics that use randomized `bootstrapping "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bootstrapping_(statistics)>`_ to provide "
"more accurate results."
msgstr ""
"使用随机 `bootstrapping "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bootstrapping_(statistics)>`_ "
"来提供更准确的策略回测结果。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:80 151d0c24e50f44f7a0bb97a0e099752a
msgid ""
"`Parameter optimization "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/12.%20Parameter%20Optimization.html>`_"
" with `Optuna <https://optuna.org/>`_ to select the best strategy "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"通过 `参数优化 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/12.%20Parameter%20Optimization.html>`_"
" 与 `Optuna <https://optuna.org/>`_ 选择最佳策略参数。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:81 016f4789c1704da69f72b09b7fcccf0b
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`Caching "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/1.%20Getting%20Started%20with%20Data%20Sources.html"
"#Caching-Data>`_ of downloaded data, indicators, and models to speed up "
"your development process."
msgstr ""
"`缓存 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/1.%20Getting%20Started%20with%20Data%20Sources.html"
"#Caching-Data>`_ 已下载的数据、指标和模型，以加速你的开发过程。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:82 2934c50df64d4ceea49836e79d5d9a5a
msgid ""
"`Parallelized "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/11.%20Configuring%20Parallelization.html>`_"
" computation and training for faster performance."
msgstr ""
"`并行化 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/11.%20Configuring%20Parallelization.html>`_"
" 计算和训练，获得更高的性能。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:83 c31bcf62d1034d39ad7b5ab4e9566f2b
msgid ""
":doc:`Agent Skills <agent-skills>` that help AI agents write trading "
"strategies and backtests using PyBroker."
msgstr ":doc:`智能体技能 <agent-skills>`，帮助 AI 智能体使用 PyBroker 编写交易策略和回测。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:86 f3de088d059a440389312fec4282260a
msgid ""
"PyBroker provides you with the tools to build, test, and evaluate "
"algorithmic trading strategies backed by machine learning."
msgstr "PyBroker 为你提供构建、测试和评估基于机器学习的算法交易策略所需的全部工具。"

